flowchart TD
    START([User starts Ralph job]) --> SANDBOX{sandbox=true?}

    SANDBOX -->|No| NATIVE[Run native subprocess<br/>existing path unchanged]
    NATIVE --> MONITOR[Monitor output.log<br/>parse activity]

    SANDBOX -->|Yes| DOCKER_CHECK{Docker installed<br/>& running?}
    DOCKER_CHECK -->|No| ERROR[Return error:<br/>'Docker not available']

    DOCKER_CHECK -->|Yes| IMAGE_CHECK{Docker image<br/>exists locally?}
    IMAGE_CHECK -->|No| BUILD[Auto-build image<br/>from claudebox base]
    BUILD --> BUILD_OK{Build<br/>succeeded?}
    BUILD_OK -->|No| BUILD_ERR[Return error<br/>with build logs]
    BUILD_OK -->|Yes| CREATE

    IMAGE_CHECK -->|Yes| CREATE[Create ephemeral container<br/>with volume mounts]
    CREATE --> MOUNTS[Mount:<br/>- project root RW<br/>- credentials RO]
    MOUNTS --> GEN_SCRIPT[Generate bash loop script<br/>for Linux container]
    GEN_SCRIPT --> RUN[Start container<br/>execute loop.sh]
    RUN --> MONITOR

    MONITOR --> DASHBOARD[Dashboard shows activity<br/>with 'Sandboxed' badge]

    DASHBOARD --> STOP{User stops job?}
    STOP -->|Yes| DOCKER_STOP[docker stop container]
    DOCKER_STOP --> REMOVE[Container auto-removed]
    STOP -->|No| COMPLETE{Job completes?}
    COMPLETE -->|Yes| REMOVE
    COMPLETE -->|No| TTL{TTL expired?}
    TTL -->|Yes| FORCE_STOP[Force stop + remove]
    TTL -->|No| MONITOR
